Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:35:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure Berkeley database lifecycle diagnostics

Convert twelve Berkeley environment open/close, database rewrite and flush diagnostics. ErrorCode is the actual return code, Error the captured Berkeley description, DatabaseVersion the original version text, and Name the database filename rather than an invented full path. Call the underlying immutable version-string API without constructing a temporary std::string. Reuse earlier SQLite registry keys; preserve severity, category and message wording. Wallet notification callbacks are untouched.

